  "label": "Islamophobia",
  "description": "The two women in the image are wearing headscarves (hijabs), which are commonly associated with Muslim women. The meme's crude and sexually suggestive text, when applied to individuals who may be perceived as Muslim, can be interpreted as reinforcing Islamophobic stereotypes. These stereotypes often involve the portrayal of Muslim women as oppressed, exoticized, or hypersexualized, which can be used to demean or caricature their identities. The meme may implicitly rely on viewers' associations of Muslim women with these stereotypes, even if not explicitly stated.",
